{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28286","headline":"长安杂题长句六首 六 · 杜牧","name":"长安杂题长句六首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丰貂长组金张辈，驷马文衣许史家。\n白鹿原头回猎骑，紫云楼下醉江花。\n九重树影连清汉，万寿山光学翠华。\n谁识大君谦让德，一毫名利鬬鼃蟇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28286.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28286","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}